Notes:
- I excluded `convo.notifyOnCompletion` from the "Reload window" prompt, because the setting is read each time a completion finishes and doesn't need a reload.
- The notification only appears when the final edit is applied successfully. Errors and the fallback untitled document don't trigger it.
- "Run Script and Complete" focuses the document before completing, so it will usually not show a notification unless you switch away while the completion is running.


